    {
      "id": "178:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42131:42133"
    },
    {
      "id": "178:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "气温很低，风逐渐变强。外面比你想象得更吵闹。你分辨不出是什么声音，只听出一种长啸。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42133:42176"
    },
    {
      "id": "178:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "听起来像是一种沉重的白噪音，像是尖叫怒号着的雪花噪音。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42176:42205"
    },
    {
      "id": "178:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "进行一次理智检定。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42205:42216"
    },
    {
      "id": "178:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定成功，转到 180。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42216:42232"
    },
    {
      "id": "178:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果检定失败，转到 179。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:42232:42248"
    }
  ]
}
